PLR 8.5 + 3.1: `with span:` / `with span as s:` bind the manager BY
REFERENCE (lvalue context exprs incl. by-ref params via deref);
__enter__/__exit__ mutate the named object (s IS span); __exit__ runs
on the exception path; break/continue bound to a loop INSIDE the with
do not run __exit__.
